==Description==
'''Titus''' was the main narrator of [[Failed Gateway]]. He also was a narrator for one wave in [[Containment]].

He had two forms. The first form was its regular form, internally called '''Titus''', which was [[Titus]] from the [[Hexscape Event]]. The second form was the corrupted form, internally called '''CorruptedTitus''' with a '''Corrupted Titus''' speaker name, which was [[Corrupted Titus]] from the [[Hexscape Event]].

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Regular
|'''Titus''' had tan skin, with a part of its face being purple. Its right arm was replaced with a mechanical arm, which had three claws and a laser blaster in it. It had blond hair. It wore a khaki shirt and blue pants, alongside brown shoes. On its left arm, it had a metal shoulder-pad, multiple brown bandages, brown glove and black brass knuckles with spikes. It also wore a purple bandanna. On its torso, it had a large brown belt connected to a brown armor piece, which protected part of its mechanical arm that was connected to the torso. It had a brown belt with pouches and a grey plate with "''4OBIA''" written on it. It also had grey knee-pads.
|Corrupted
|'''Corrupted Titus''' had grey skin, with a part of its face being purple with neon purple veins. Its right arm was replaced with a mechanical arm, which had three claws and a laser blaster in it. It had grey hair. It wore a grey shirt and blue pants, alongside brown shoes. On its left arm, it had a metal shoulder-pad, multiple brown bandages, brown glove and black brass knuckles with spikes. It also wore a grey bandanna. On its torso, it had a large brown belt connected to a brown armor piece, which protected part of its mechanical arm that was connected to the torso. It had a brown belt with pouches and a grey plate with "''CRR6PT''" written on it. It also had grey knee-pads.
}}

